    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure we solution adheres to these security and compliance requirements, especially considering the constraints around personal data protection and professional responsibility? we are committed to ensuring the highest level of security and compliance in our solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a company, we holds ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which encompasses the development, delivery, and operations of we services, including the scope of privacy information management through we ISO 27701 certification." ;
