    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "ISO 27001 certification allows we to manage sensitive data securely." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address GDPR compliance, we implement robust data protection measures. robust data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. we key management is based on the EU-based infrastructure, ensuring that all cryptographic keys are securely managed within the EU. we also employ strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, alongside access controls that prevent any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we use pseudonymisation to further protect sensitive information. we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, provides a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, which supports sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that all data are hosted within the EU and not transferred outside, adhering to the data sovereignty requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For audit trail and compliance purposes, we maintain a complete log of access and every system output. we solution, Atelier, is designed with explainability and auditability in mind, providing grounded and traceable figures or factual statements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This transparency supports internal quality control and statutory audit reviews, ensuring that we outputs are reliable and compliant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the importance of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, we have appointed a Data Protection Officer (DPO) and maintain a data processing register. we Data Processing Agreement (DPA) is aligned with GDPR Article 28, ensuring that all data processing activities are legally compliant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To prevent leakage of data between client files, we ensure strict partitioning and access controls." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All sensitive data are protected through encryption or pseudonymisation as appropriate, and our solution supports the preparation of recurring documents and facilitates collaboration among professionals while ensuring the integrity and security of client data. we also prioritize the environmental sustainability of we infrastructure, aiming for a low carbon footprint." ;
